[24.536963, "o", "         ID   First      Last   Dept    Position  Salary  Years   Location  Score\r\n0  EMP00001     Joe     Brown     QA  QA Manager  112000      7    Houston    4.3\r\n1  EMP00002  Brenda  Thompson     IT         DBA   58000      0         LA    3.0\r\n2  EMP00003    Nick     Brown  Legal   Paralegal  157000      7  San Diego    4.0\r\n3  EMP00004   James      King     QA    Auto Eng  137000      8    Houston    3.0\r\n4  EMP00005   Carol    Harris  Sales  BizDev Rep   74000     11      Miami    4.0\r\n\r\n--- PDF Data Inspection ---\r\n"]
